# Auto commit and deploy

When implementation work for a user request is done (build succeeds if applicable):

1. Create a git commit following the repo commit protocol (status, diff, log, HEREDOC message).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch so Vercel can deploy.
3. Do **not** ask whether to commit or deploy — do it by default unless the user explicitly says not to commit/push.

Still never commit secrets, never force-push, never amend unless the usual amend conditions are met.
